{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "c8ae46454babba57b57983032b54fc11a6dc318cfa20b3dc148140c452d4e51f", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nよかった、やっと会えました♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n太好了，终于找到你了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "51a36439bce8387b9a5f265d42d37fbc9dd102056836ae5c69f9d206bd780383", "ja": "バタバタしていてすみません。\n俺に、何か用事でしたか？", "zh": "不好意思，今天事情比较多。\n你找我有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "63edf74b7574709a26186d2cdb592e2a15850db7d2c3caf59e62df7b7f818c46", "ja": "はい！　社長さんから、\n{$P$}さんにお話があるそうですよ！", "zh": "是的！社长似乎有话要对\n{$P$}先生说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5069402ba6e8fa044ee810ee110c577fe3212084e5a0059f8c6a7e7df665b1b2", "ja": "なんだろう……。のり子のプロレスパフォーマンスで\nセットが傾いた件が、耳に入ったんじゃ……。", "zh": "会是什么事呢……难道社长听说了？\n法子表演职业摔角把布景弄歪的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "a89ad0343a65f409f350121bc411587b186b8471f049df5ccfbfeba526b47bdb", "ja": "きっといいお話だと思いますよ～。\n社長さん、なんだか楽しそうでしたから。", "zh": "我猜应该是要说好消息喔～\n因为社长看起来还挺开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "0e1ca5f1f414085b611da9554c0344fda0952fe530943bb3e87228333d103214", "ja": "それじゃ、{$P$}さん、\nいってらっしゃーい！", "zh": "那么{$P$}先生，\n请慢走！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1006_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "40848386c177002f21f8d7318c30bf5544060915651e126ad5d258fc5610651c", "ja": "失礼します。\nあの、お話があると聞いて来たんですが……。", "zh": "打扰了。\n呃，听说社长你有事要找我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "7fd8c39f612c4c330596828a147da28cfbacaf62b5d270fddcba345661171a3c", "ja": "あっ、お疲れ様です、{$P$}さん！\n社長がお待ちかねですよ♪", "zh": "啊，工作辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n社长已经快等不及了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1009_president", "source_sha256": "6ab733137225da2a5437c7f1e7a9ccb1a22530ba6e14fb3924037dbaf63886ce", "ja": "うむ。待ちかねたよ、君……。\n今日は君に伝えなければいけないことがある！", "zh": "嗯，我等你好久了……\n今天有件事情一定要告诉你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cbf7c8366a34cd293b96d588ca84be34d67ce94aa506ba97404c491a96d389c9", "ja": "うっ、やっぱりのり子の件ですか？　すみません！\nでも会場は大盛り上がりで、セットもロコがもう……！", "zh": "唔，社长果然是要说法子的事吗？非常抱歉！\n不过会场的气氛相当热烈，ROCO也已经把布景……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "ab27dc90c91d692f732eaad44a3b86ab1503ed761a13b351d0b4394bb7b20ed4", "ja": "おおっ、察しがいいじゃないか！\nそう、福田のり子君達の話だよ！", "zh": "哦哦，你很敏锐嘛！\n没错，我要说的就是福田法子她们的事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5707ac930c13a14a4aeb43b0bb88fdca7cbcef99a4296a831d477e5db541daaf", "ja": "ん？　のり子君……達、ですか？", "zh": "嗯？社长是说法子……「她们」吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "99d1df220c71cf68629dc5746f312c572717f46a6c12edb3812823978399e87f", "ja": "そう、今日は君に、\nまた新たなユニットを託したいと思ってね。", "zh": "没错，\n我今天是想再请你带一个新的团体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8004574882e49f58cec7632b9abd92cf932c10bb09b6451683d639c42113b23d", "ja": "おお、新しいユニットの話でしたか！\nよかった……！", "zh": "哦哦，原来社长是要跟我说新团体的事情啊！\n太好了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "c20ec594d23d443c80aadfa4c60a5e0f811baa085538a1248534670e71c2a582", "ja": "ふふふ、そうだろう、よかっただろう？\n君ならそう言ってくれると信じていたよ！", "zh": "呵呵呵，对吧，你也觉得很不错吧？\n我就知道你会这么说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "ac4a781176c1c1165edfa48bf0fd4b8d9a2d89eb0b510826ded03a6d84087167", "ja": "ユニットのメンバーは、天海春香君、松田亜利沙君、\n周防桃子君、福田のり子君、横山奈緒君の5名だ。", "zh": "团体的成员是天海春香、松田亚利沙、\n周防桃子、福田法子、横山奈绪五个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "599528e1d28fff8f78d236f25a8e26fd2abbf0ac8bf15c7ae873d8761dae0320", "ja": "そしてリーダーは、天海君に一任しようと思う。\n彼女なら適任だろうからね！", "zh": "至于队长我想让天海来担纲。\n我想她一定可以胜任！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "903815a779450d8c7229aa4b708c1303064b6d62d61bddad04451c6f65fd2518", "ja": "そうですね。\n春香なら、後輩達を上手くまとめてくれると思います。", "zh": "社长说得是。\n春香应该可以把后辈们带领得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "037c64bc73173b898849ba348b4724ba2e0f93454eab30fc17c1b17d3eb8dcac", "ja": "春香ちゃん、最近ぐっと大人っぽくなりましたよね！\n今回も、素敵なユニットになりそうです。", "zh": "春香最近也突然变得很成熟呢！\n这次应该也会组成很棒的团体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "3ce2479e6dbdc0c130b8d3f7d9e2fd03ad58a3242fbaeaeb26b649c0e0e7a7db", "ja": "彼女達ならば、プロデュース次第で\nこれまで以上に素晴らしいユニットになるだろう！", "zh": "她们几个只要加以培育，\n一定可以成为比现在更好的团体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "edf721c6a43ab22789ef8d79e15a54de8b1a5eba57aa37775715b4aa31a2f38e", "ja": "と、思っているわけだが……どうかね？\n引き受けてくれるかね？", "zh": "我是这样想的……如何？\n你愿意接下这个任务吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_1022", "source_sha256": "1328858b72076382b4434a1d60241e572fa393e0e21d8022ddd6bd6bcd0ca477", "ja": "任せてください！", "zh": "请交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "38b01b58598a0fc3d7ba6ab78dbcb37f1f9b0174deafaeb07327c241d5491d6e", "ja": "その言葉を待っていました。\nもちろん、任せてください！", "zh": "我就等社长这句话。\n这是当然，请交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "8ba6b9767886a41b714b051e5608c22cf23492540f9a8db70aef31bf25f04188", "ja": "いい返事だ！\n今回もひとつ、よろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "很棒的回答！\n这次也麻烦你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_2002_101kot", "source_sha256": "9ac1e76ddee6fcd04138c2584f68df2c5ec9bc557b2d0d6da2a6ff93516a790f", "ja": "ちなみに社長、確かユニット名は、\nもうお決まりなんでしたよね？", "zh": "对了，社长，\n我记得团体名称也已经决定好了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_2003_president", "source_sha256": "ca04fed0b3a0f47a2d88ddf50f99cbbee64e314a3f0527117cbc54827a1a3062", "ja": "うむ。『リコッタ』という名前にしようと思う。\nどうだね、いい響きだろう？", "zh": "嗯，我想把新团体取名为『Ricotta』。\n如何，很响亮吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_2004_101kot", "source_sha256": "6a6e6a81f5e05b4cafd818a0a8e0f10d83129351499d08cc3ccf17e345341a34", "ja": "春香ちゃんがお菓子作りに使っていた、\nチーズの名前からつけたんだそうです♪", "zh": "这个名字似乎是取自春香做点心的时候，\n用到的起司名称♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_2005_p", "source_sha256": "fc8c4ebb29a0f76afc81cc0f521be4b186770120846515ce84a682a38303b641", "ja": "なるほど。\nどことなく甘くて可愛い雰囲気で、いいですね！", "zh": "原来如此。\n有一种甜美可爱的感觉，真不错呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_2006_president", "source_sha256": "42db735b59d3bade980602f45cd201e662c571cbc4f17403cc31c24502bb0090", "ja": "うむ。\nはっけよい、リコッタ！　なんてね！", "zh": "嗯。\n她抓得住我，『Ricotta』！之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_2007_101kot", "source_sha256": "bc4059180381e672c19825c27fc1beede2d064d5fdcbdf122999b6c8be3c40ca", "ja": "社長？\nそれはのこったですよ？", "zh": "社长，\n你想说的是那句广告台词吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_2008_president", "source_sha256": "dce98a5e02bf88e87745cedc2aff5f4522c31b53950088f5951c9719899f6938", "ja": "あ、あれ？　面白くなかったかね？\n会心のギャグだったんだが……。", "zh": "怪、怪了？不好笑吗？\n我还挺喜欢这个哏的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_intro_2009_p", "source_sha256": "606b18019e56d3e34bca49e904b85dfbf7eb6443aec071d4d60dc314f077311c", "ja": "（リコッタ……名前的にもメンバー的にも、明るく楽し\nいユニットになりそうだ。早速みんなに知らせよう！）", "zh": "（『Ricotta』……不管是名字还是成员，\n都感觉会是一个开朗愉快的团体。赶快去告诉大家吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
